{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:27b6cb987aa67efaac6f:cc10476695416d49", "cohort": "revision-aero-002", "current_report_sha256": "1878f456acb7d76acbf8914befd3b7ebf4254e00d6e15538b0f101e8e2199933", "issuer_company": "中信造船", "issuer_ticker": "2644", "normalized_claim_hash": "cc10476695416d49573a63852c56e572512207719ddecdceada61455f36b3450", "original_text": "嘉實投顧於2025年6月18日更新的中信造船產業資料，在「鋁合金板／鋼板」項下列出中鋼；中信造船111年度年報亦將中鋼列於該類別的「主要供應商」表。兩份資料均未區分中鋼供應的板材種類，也不足以確立其截至2026年10月8日的供應或主要供應商地位。", "parent_claim": {"author_batch_id": "author-001", "author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-001.json", "author_batch_sha256": "e6b4335b6a1f7f5ba8dcb0c3f6a76e3aaac1d7c573a7c9f8ac81476e286c79ce", "author_decision": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "claim_id": "2644:material_named_relationship:5c551327d27428ea", "issuer_company": "中信造船", "issuer_ticker": "2644", "normalized_claim_hash": "5c551327d27428ea984cf180716d7660497e1074b3d0776f3e2318ed7db2bd93", "original_text": "[[中鋼]] — 造船用鋼板主要供應商", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2644_中信造船.md"}, "parent_claim_id": "2644:material_named_relationship:5c551327d27428ea", "parent_effective_verdict": "PARTIAL", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "- **鋼材:** [[中鋼]] — 造船用鋼板主要供應商", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "2644 - 中信造船"}, {"level": 2, "line": 11, "text": "供應鏈位置"}], "line": 13}], "purpose": "Original statement context only; not factual evidence.", "report_sha256": "1878f456acb7d76acbf8914befd3b7ebf4254e00d6e15538b0f101e8e2199933", "requested_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2644_中信造船.md", "resolved_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2644_中信造船.md"}, "proposal_binding": {"input_path": "audit-v5/semantic/candidate-rerun/revision-aero-001/delivery/outcomes.jsonl", "input_sha256": "cf2d8b226e2f2ffa51dca6f21efa2ec7afaf802ef044692da42dbe16eb731490", "proposed_by": "alternative from revision-aero-001", "proposed_text_sha256": "cc10476695416d49573a63852c56e57