{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:531a67a7a5cd5b4b364b:0240e056f7a5f832", "cohort": "revision-aero-002", "current_report_sha256": "1878f456acb7d76acbf8914befd3b7ebf4254e00d6e15538b0f101e8e2199933", "issuer_company": "中信造船", "issuer_ticker": "2644", "normalized_claim_hash": "0240e056f7a5f83249371e3c987a16cc18ca61ae4776082277f0e2a7362d6656", "original_text": "中信造船（2644）於2026年4月24日代重要子公司高鼎遊艇公告，文中載明「本公司持股100%」；2026年10月10日擷取的中信造船官網「廠房介紹」頁自稱高鼎遊艇為「全亞洲最大鋼鋁遊艇專門製造公司」。", "parent_claim": {"claim_id": "2644:objective_ranking_or_market_share:86ac48389e66b77d", "cohort": "original", "issuer_company": "中信造船", "issuer_ticker": "2644", "lineage": {"author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-001.json", "author_batch_sha256": "e6b4335b6a1f7f5ba8dcb0c3f6a76e3aaac1d7c573a7c9f8ac81476e286c79ce", "index_path": "audit-v5/semantic/accepted-review-index.json", "index_sha256": "c96559ac7abc529ef2acb312d72dc8527bcdee4a9b420fd74c54579b06ba68f9"}, "normalized_claim_hash": "86ac48389e66b77d57c3e9611de18240117d6d4face215e851eff1a326a2a477", "original_text": "旗下子公司高鼎遊艇為亞洲最大鋼鋁遊艇製造商。", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2644_中信造船.md", "source_leads": [{"locator": "HTML廠房介紹／四廠區高鼎段", "title": "廠房介紹 | 中信造船", "url": "https://www.jongshyn.com/about1.asp"}, {"locator": "PDF實體4頁廠區分布", "title": "正式PDF檢視：中信造船", "url": "https://www.sname.org.tw/sname/ckfinder_2.6.3/userfiles/files/250801_%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%A1%E9%80%A0%E8%88%B9%E5%9C%A8%E5%9C%8B%E9%98%B2%E5%B7%A5%E6%A5%AD%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E8%88%87%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4-%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%A1%E9%80%A0%E8%88%B9%E8%94%A1%E5%B1%95%E5%BC%98%E7%B6%93%E7%90%86.pdf"}]}, "parent_claim_id": "2644:objective_ranking_or_market_share:86ac48389e66b77d", "parent_effective_verdict": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "中信造船 (2644，Jong Shyn Shipbuilding) 為台灣規模最大的民營造船廠，由「台灣船王」韓碧祥創辦。公司主要業務涵蓋：(1) 軍艦建造 — 承建海軍輕型巡防艦原型艦 2 艘 (預算 90.5 億元)，搭載[[Lockheed Martin]] CMS-330 戰鬥管理系統，後續量產 10 艘加速中；(2) 海巡艦艇 — 自 2018 年起承攬[[海巡署]] 81 艘巡防艦艇計畫 (總值 215 億元)，含 600 噸級安平艦系列；(3) 商船與漁船 — 建造貨輪、客輪、超低溫鮪釣漁船等；(4) 無人艇 — 開發「中信五號」無人艇，年產能逾 200 艘，競標海軍無人艇計畫。旗下子公司高鼎遊艇為亞洲最大鋼鋁遊艇製造商。在手訂單逾 200 億元。", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "2644 - 中信造船"}, {"level": 2, "line": 3, "text": "業務簡介"}], "line": 9}], "purpose": "Original statement context only; not factual evidence.", "report_sha256": "1878f456acb7d76acbf8914befd3b7ebf4254e00d6e15538b0f101e8e2199933", "requested_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2644_中信造船.md", "resolved_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2644_中信造船.md"}, "proposal_binding": {"input_path": "audit-v5/semantic/candidate-rerun/revision-aero-001/delivery/outcomes.jsonl", "input_sha256": "cf2d8b226e2f2ffa51dca6f21efa2ec7afaf802ef044692da42dbe16eb731490", "proposed_by": "alternative from revision-aero-001", "proposed_text_sha256": "0240e056f7a5f83249371e3c987a16cc18ca61ae4776082277f0e2a7362d6656"}, "proposed_target_section": "業務與歷史資料", "qualifier_changes": [{"change": "修正句明列日期或年度，不能轉為未限定當期", "term": "期間"}], "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2644_中信造船.md", "source_leads": [{"locator": "公告標題及正文第240–315行", "title": "中信造船：代重要子公司高鼎遊艇股份有限公司公告董監任期屆滿暨法人股東重新指派董監事", "url": "https://news.cnyes.com/news/id/6431870"}, {"locator": "「高鼎廠 Jade Yachts」段；擷取文字第554–555行", "title": "廠房介紹｜中信造船", "url": "https://www.jongshyn.com/about1.asp"}], "supersedes_revision_id": "revision:531a67a7a5cd5b4b364b:18c953307b689437"}
{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:ad3256926abcb7df95f5:c37708e7f1d07a5f", "cohort": "revision-aero-002", "current_report_sha256": "037e8f2a9fbc420818e7841526629094019f3099208ee623637c9b05b0bec6f6", "issuer_company": "長榮航太", "issuer_ticker": "2645", "normalized_claim_hash": "c37708e7f1d07a5f2914c57954bbf1fbbf58539d2beb24f912602041a857da6d", "original_text": "長榮航太於2025年5月9日宣布已簽署與空中巴士的合作合約，成為其機體組件一階供應商；長榮航太2025年5月19日法說簡報表示，直接供應組件至空巴產線。", "parent_claim": {"author_batch_id": "author-175", "author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-175.json", "author_batch_sha256": "770a30f8906dea9f8ce971e42bc7a4b98d3dbf1c3603a75195c9e5183155b957", "author_decision": "UNKNOWN_AFTER_RESEARCH", "claim_id": "2645:material_named_relationship:25d41503b8a9ab48", "issuer_company": "長榮航太", "issuer_ticker": "2645", "normalized_claim_hash": "25d41503b8a9ab4878c106c9f7c14c9e29966b678c503015270187a2abca83e9", "original_text": "[[Airbus]] — 原廠件供應與認證", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2645_長榮航太.md"}, "parent_claim_id": "2645:material_named_relationship:25d41503b8a9ab48", "parent_effective_verdict": "PARTIAL", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "- **機體零件:** [[Airbus]] — 原廠件供應與認證", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "2645 - 長榮航太"}, {"level": 2, "line": 11, "text": "供應鏈位置"}], "line": 14}], "purpose": "Original statement context only; not factual evidence.", "report_sha256": "037e8f2a9fbc420818e7841526629094019f3099208ee623637c9b05b0bec6f6", "requested_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2645_長榮航太.md", "resolved_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2645_長榮航太.md"}, "proposal_binding": {"input_path": "audit-v5/semantic/candidate-rerun/revision-aero-001/delivery/outcomes.jsonl", "input_sha256": "cf2d8b226e2f2ffa51dca6f21efa2ec7afaf802ef044692da42dbe16eb731490", "proposed_by": "alternative from revision-aero-001", "proposed_text_sha256": "c37708e7f1d07a5f2914c57954bbf1fbbf58539d2beb24f912602041a857da6d"}, "