{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:b3d5ae34eced1fdbff67:c351d1dc22d8bd4d", "cohort": "revision-aero-002", "current_report_sha256": "037e8f2a9fbc420818e7841526629094019f3099208ee623637c9b05b0bec6f6", "issuer_company": "長榮航太", "issuer_ticker": "2645", "normalized_claim_hash": "c351d1dc22d8bd4d6f05a95b13e0e880b2a71fbd5770333afa4064b1ca59d6dd", "original_text": "中央社於 2025 年 5 月 9 日引述長榮航太表示，波音為其既有製造客戶，且公司已與空中巴士簽署合作合約，成為空巴機體組件一階供應商。長榮航太於 2025 年 5 月 19 日法說會簡報的「營運策略」中，稱其合作模式為直接供應組件至空巴產線。所查波音供應商專題未標示長榮航太的 Boeing 合約 Tier 1 層級。", "parent_claim": {"author_batch_id": "author-175", "author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-175.json", "author_batch_sha256": "770a30f8906dea9f8ce971e42bc7a4b98d3dbf1c3603a75195c9e5183155b957", "author_decision": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "claim_id": "2645:material_named_relationship:8a2772f0488a5e3a", "issuer_company": "長榮航太", "issuer_ticker": "2645", "normalized_claim_hash": "8a2772f0488a5e3a0b268ac49c525ccfaf921ec8943733ba132a7e0987704245", "original_text": "製造端為[[Boeing]]與[[Airbus]]之 Tier 1 供應商，2025 年正式升格為[[Airbus]]一階機體零組件直供商。", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2645_長榮航太.md"}, "parent_claim_id": "2645:material_named_relationship:8a2772f0488a5e3a", "parent_effective_verdict": "PARTIAL", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "長榮航太科技 (2645，Evergreen Aviation Technologies / EGAT) 為全球頂尖航空維修 ([[MRO]]) 及機體零組件製造商，由[[長榮航空]]與[[GE Aerospace]]合資成立。機體維修服務涵蓋超過 40 家國際航空公司，為全球最大的[[波音]] 747 重度維修廠，可維修機型涵蓋 B747/B767/B777/B787/A320/A330 系列，並積極擴展 A350 及 B737 MAX 維修能量。製造端為[[Boeing]]與[[Airbus]]之 Tier 1 供應商，2025 年正式升格為[[Airbus]]一階機體零組件直供商。旗下與[[GE Aerospace]]合資之長異發動機維修專責 GEnx 引擎 MRO。近期跨足軍工領域，承接國防部艦載型監偵[[無人機]] 16 架標案 (4.02 億元)。", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "2645 - 長榮航太"}, {"level": 2, "line": 3, "text": "業務簡介"}], "line": 9}], "purpose": "Original statement context only; not factual evidence.", "report_sha256": "037e8f2a9fbc420818e7841526629094019f3099208ee623637c9b05b0bec6f6", "requested_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2645_長榮航太.md", "resolved_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2645_長榮航太.md"}, "proposal_binding": {"input_path": "audit-v5/semantic/candidate-rerun/revision-aero-001/delivery/outcomes.jsonl", "input_sha256": "cf2d8b226e2f2ffa51dca6f21efa2ec7afaf802ef044692da42dbe16eb731490", "proposed_by": "alternative from revision-aero-001", "proposed_text_sha256": "c351d1dc22d8bd4d6f05a95b13e0e880b2a71fbd5770333afa4064b1ca59d6dd"}, "proposed_target_section": "業務與歷史資料", "qualifier_changes": [{"change": "修正句明列日期或年度，不能轉為未限定當期", "term": "期間"}], "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2645_長榮航太.md", "source_leads": [{"locator": "Page 1, supplier tenure and Boeing-associated products.", "title": "Evergreen Aviation Technologies Corp. — Boeing Supplier Spotlight", "url": "https://www.boeing.com/content/dam/boeing/boeingdotcom/suppliers/Evergreen-Aviation-Technologies-Corp.pdf"}, {"locator": "Paragraphs 277–280.", "title": "長榮航太打入空巴產業鏈 列一階機體組件供應商", "url": "https://www.cna.com.tw/news/afe/202505090267.aspx"}, {"locator": "Search-indexed passage on EGAT’s Tier-1 system-parts supply-chain capability and Boeing 777 RCB/MDCD orders.", "title": "112-113年工業發展年鑑, 第二篇金屬機電產業篇, 第四章重機產業", "url": "https://www.ida.gov.tw/ctlr?PRO=filepath.DownloadFile&f=publication&id=3474&t=f"}, {"locator": "營運策略 slide, bullet stating the Airbus agreement was completed and components would be supplied directly to the Airbus production line.", "title": "長榮航太法人說明會, 2025-05-19", "url": "https://www.egat.com.tw/documents/295/PPTfashuohuai519chinese.pdf"}], "supersedes_revision_id": "revision:b3d5ae34eced1fdbff67:b45ef825cf7c0d77"}
{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:e3c9e3856a0625d11ebf:fc150dba0343784d", "cohort": "revision-aero-002", "current_report_sha256": "037e8f2a9fbc420818e7841526629094019f3099208ee623637c9b05b0bec6f6", "issuer_company": "長榮航太", "issuer_ticker": "2645", "normalized_claim_hash": "fc150dba0343784d29f74669ee9b4c01d8d4f944e106ef25ea0e85225a59d9fc", "original_text": "2026年10月10日擷取的長榮航太官網稱，其在全球服務超過40家航空公司，並列A320系列、A330、B747、B767及B787為機體維修專長。Aviation Week於2023年5月9日報導EGAT提供B777停機坪維修。Airways於2025年10月23日引用Cirium資料稱EGAT為全球四引擎飛機C檢及重大維修的最大提供者，並在下一句稱EGAT為全球最大的波音747 MRO提供者。長榮航太2025年5月法說資料將A350及B737 MAX列為新機型能量開發與客戶擴展項目。", "parent_claim": {"author_batch_id": "author-002", "author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-002.json", "author_batch_sha256": "8cb4f83e85714de51a54ca2f92198c8426d7f3d447677e5c0c793481909244e9", "author_decision": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "claim_id": "2645:objective_ranking_or_market_share:acb07c2f05995949", "issuer_company": "長榮航太", "issuer_ticker": "2645", "normalized_claim_hash": "acb07c2f05995949a72a6d0c190e016489fc3dc71f58f1f9990154e19b09035c", "original_text": "機體維修服務涵蓋超過 40 家國際航空公司，為全球最大的[[波音]] 747 重度維修廠，可維修機型涵蓋 B747/B767/B777/B787/A320/A330 系列，並積極擴展 A350 及 B737 MAX 維修能量。", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/2645_長榮航太.md"}, "parent_claim_id": "2645:objective_ranking_or_market_share:acb07c2f05995949", "parent_effective_verdict": "PARTIAL", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "長榮航太科技 (2645，Evergreen Aviation Technologies / EGAT) 為全球頂尖航空維修 ([[MRO]]) 及機體零組件製造商，由[[長榮航空]]與[[GE Aerospace]]合資成立。機體維修服務涵蓋超過 40 家國際航空公司，為全球最大的[[波音]] 747 重度維修廠，可維修機型涵蓋 B747/B767/B777/B787/A320/A330 系列，並積極擴展 A350 及 B737 MAX 維修能量。製造端為[[Boeing]]與[[Airbus]]之 Tier 1 供應商，2025 年正式升格為[[Airbus]]一階機體零組件直供商。旗下與[[GE Aerospace]]合資之長異發動機維修專責 GEnx 引擎 MRO。近期跨足軍工領域，承接國防部艦載型監偵[[無人機]] 16 架標案 (4.02 億元)。", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "2645 - 長榮航太"}, {"level": 2, "line": 3, "text": "業務簡介"}], "line": 9}], "purpose": "Original statemen