{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:690880274fc97200ca6b:b0b1012682273dc4", "cohort": "revision-aero-002", "current_report_sha256": "4e83ddc50dbc451de1396b7fd64c2fca0928c72fc2125e1351c20a3836c3eb74", "issuer_company": "晟田", "issuer_ticker": "4541", "normalized_claim_hash": "b0b1012682273dc45fe8f119fda4088d4e2a096962038b9febb8ee7f0f967c30", "original_text": "晟田112年度年報列有飲料、食品及醫藥無菌充填包裝與鎖蓋機設備精密組件；114年度年報的「其他」產品營收占比為6.35%，該類別包含食品機械、精密機械等零件加工，未單列食品包裝設備占比。", "parent_claim": {"author_batch_id": "author-176", "author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-176.json", "author_batch_sha256": "41bc6e33fadea51dd9aa0c5b45047c6bc27450584d51897416cce8a5f4b6ea97", "author_decision": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "claim_id": "4541:material_named_relationship:df473dfcdc3e30d8", "issuer_company": "晟田", "issuer_ticker": "4541", "normalized_claim_hash": "df473dfcdc3e30d821646b3a1a6e917530bd8ea55cdc9ced1e243e68efd115ff", "original_text": "(3) 食品包裝設備 (佔約 10%) — 供應[[三菱重工]]等食品飲料充填設備零組件。", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md"}, "parent_claim_id": "4541:material_named_relationship:df473dfcdc3e30d8", "parent_effective_verdict": "PARTIAL", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "晟田科技工業 (4541，Magnate Technology) 專注於高精密五軸 CNC 金屬加工，核心技術為超合金與難切削材料 ([[鈦合金]]、[[鎳基合金]]、Inconel) 之精密成型。業務結構：(1) 航太零組件 (佔營收約 75%) — 為[[漢翔]]、[[Safran Landing Systems]]、住友精密 ([[SPP]])、[[MOOG]]、[[三菱重工]]等供應起落架、發動機零件與機體結構件，終端客戶涵蓋[[GE Aerospace]]、[[Rolls-Royce]]、[[Boeing]]；(2) 半導體設備 (佔約 15%) — 為設備廠供應關鍵次系統零組件；(3) 食品包裝設備 (佔約 10%) — 供應[[三菱重工]]等食品飲料充填設備零組件。公司持有 AS9100、AS13100 及 Nadcap 等航太認證，為台灣 A-Team 4.0 核心成員。", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "4541 - 晟田"}, {"level": 2, "line": 3, "text": "業務簡介"}], "line": 9}], "purpose": "Original statement context only; not factual evidence.", "report_sha256": "4e83ddc50dbc451de1396b7fd64c2fca0928c72fc2125e1351c20a3836c3eb74", "requested_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md", "resolved_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md"}, "proposal_binding": {"input_path": "audit-v5/semantic/candidate-rerun/revision-aero-001/delivery/outcomes.jsonl", "input_sha256": "cf2d8b226e2f2ffa51dca6f21efa2ec7afaf802ef044692da42dbe16eb731490", "proposed_by": "alternative from revision-aero-001", "proposed_text_sha256": "b0b1012682273dc45fe8f119fda4088d4e2a096962038b9febb8ee7f0f967c30"}, "proposed_target_section": "業務與歷史資料", "qualifier_changes": [{"change": "修正句明列日期或年度，不能轉為未限定當期", "term": "期間"}], "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md", "source_leads": [{"locator": "Page 47, product revenue mix, lines 2462–2471", "title": "晟田科技工業股份有限公司 112年度年報", "url": "https://maicl.com/upload/sponsor/2024062010004194.pdf"}, {"locator": "Pages 4 and 44–54", "title": "晟田科技工業股份有限公司 114年度年報", "url": "https://www.maicl.com/upload/sponsor/2026063010155057.pdf"}, {"locator": "Company overview, section “公司簡介及主要業務與產品”", "title": "櫃買新星：興櫃4541 晟田科技工業股份有限公司", "url": "https://www.tpex.org.tw/storage/co_report/2013/08/1377746410_13472_CH_%E6%AB%83%E8%B2%B7%E6%96%B0%E6%98%9F_%E8%88%88%E6%AB%834541.pdf"}], "supersedes_revision_id": "revision:690880274fc97200ca6b:2b3a29dd89b55958"}
{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:9f3c73ac8d922f80f01b:41ef703be36ca299", "cohort": "revision-aero-002", "current_report_sha256": "4e83ddc50dbc451de1396b7fd64c2fca0928c72fc2125e1351c20a3836c3eb74", "issuer_company": "晟田", "issuer_ticker": "4541", "normalized_claim_hash": "41ef703be36ca2996123d21ab4cef8c1d4158e7fd76f77dc7bebedd3f813fe3d", "original_text": "華南投顧2026年1月20日訪談報告的2024年客戶營收組成表列漢翔占比41%。晟田114年度年報的113年度主要銷貨客戶表將第一名匿名列為「甲公司」，占全年銷貨淨額42.20%，未揭露其身份；但表列甲公司銷貨583,728仟元除以全年銷貨淨額1,416,505仟元約為41.21%，與表列百分比不符。年報列有發動機、起落架等航太零組件及波音、空巴機型應用；《自由財經》2025年3月29日報導晟田引擎零組件的終端客戶包括波音與空巴。上述資料不足以確認甲公司即漢翔、相關商用零組件均經漢翔轉供，或兩家OEM均接收發動機與機體零件。", "parent_claim": {"author_batch_id": "author-176", "author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-176.json", "author_batch_sha256": "41bc6e33fadea51dd9aa0c5b45047c6bc27450584d51897416cce8a5f4b6ea97", "author_decision": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "claim_id": "4541:material_named_relationship:bcf536822f52729b", "issuer_company": "晟田", "issuer_ticker": "4541", "normalized_claim_hash": "bcf536822f52729b64ccb533bbc10778ce417f1609d2c80c8ff2e6926b96b0d6", "original_text": "[[漢翔]] — 41% 營收，間接供應[[Boeing]]、[[Airbus]]引擎與機體零組件", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md"}, "parent_claim_id": "4541:material_named_relationship:bcf536822f52729b", "parent_effective_verdict": "PARTIAL", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "  - [[漢翔]] — 41% 營收，間接供應[[Boeing]]、[[Airbus]]引擎與機體零組件", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "4541 - 晟田"}, {"level": 2, "line": 26, "text": "主要客戶及供應商"}, {"level": 3, "line": 27, "text": "主要客戶"}], "line": 29}], "purpose": "Original statement context only; not factual evidence.", "report_sha256": "4e83ddc50dbc451de1396b7fd64c2fca0928c72fc2125e1351c20a3836c3eb74", "requested_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md", "resolved_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md"}, "proposal_binding": {"input_path": "audit-v5/semantic/candidate-rerun/revision-aero-001/delivery/outcomes.jsonl", "input_sha256": "cf2d8b226e2f2ffa51dca6f21efa2ec7afaf802ef044692da42dbe16eb731490", "proposed_by": "alternative from revision-aero-001", "proposed_text_sha256": "41ef703be36ca2996123d21ab4cef8c1d4158e7fd76f77dc7bebedd3f813fe3d"}, "proposed_target_section": "業務與歷史資料", "qualifier_changes": [{"change": "修正句明列日期或年度，不能轉為未限定當期", "term": "期間"}, {"change": "試批次另置業務與歷史資料段，原主要關係限定不自動繼承", "term": "原段落主要關係"}], "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md", "source_leads": [{"locator": "PDF第2頁，「晟田主要客戶營收結構」表", "title": "華南投顧 4541 晟田研究報告", "url": "https://www.scribd.com/document/984689855/%E8%8F%AF%E5%8D%97%E6%8A%95%E9%A1%A7-4541-%E6%99%9F%E7%94%B0-1150120"}, {"locator": "第48、50、53至54頁", "title": "晟田科技工業股份有限公司114年度年報", "url": "https://www.maicl.com/upload/sponsor/2026063010155057.pdf"}, {"locator": "公司簡介段", "title": "櫃買新星：晟田科技工業股份有限公司上櫃資料", "url": "https://www.tpex.org.tw/storage/co_report/2014/10/1414562611_6512_CH_%E6%AB%83%E8%B2%B7%E6%96%B0%E6%98%9F4541.pdf"}, {"locator": "正文第81行附近", "title": "飆股幕後》搶進軍工領域 晟田本月大漲47%", "url": "https://ec.ltn.com.tw/article/paper/1698999"}], "supersedes_revision_id": "revision:9f3c73ac8d922f80f01b:6d371b3af44c9820"}
{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:fada393e103fcd02879f:eed2db502cb760d5", "cohort": "revision-aero-002", "current_report_sha256": "4e83ddc50dbc451de1396b7fd64c2fca0928c72fc2125e1351c20a3836c3eb74", "issuer_company": "晟田", "issuer_ticker": "4541", "normalized_claim_hash": "eed2db502cb760d535439b199019c987c54e7549122fb7fa5af7494fc3281dca", "original_text": "晟田科技工業（4541）114年度年報載明，114年度航太收入占整體營業收入約68%；公司官網沿革記載，1997年開始生產漢翔民航機零件，2001年接獲日本住友精密公司（SPP）航空熱交換器零組件訂單。", "parent_claim": {"author_batch_id": "author-176", "author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-176.json", "author_batch_sha256": "41bc6e33fadea51dd9aa0c5b45047c6bc27450584d51897416cce8a5f4b6ea97", "author_decision": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "claim_id": "4541:material_named_relationship:2ab6d5fc7471158f", "issuer_company": "晟田", "issuer_ticker": "4541", "normalized_claim_hash": "2ab6d5fc7471158fbdd8657687752700b5492e54748df61ae42f263e75cbf591", "original_text": "業務結構：(1) 航太零組件 (佔營收約 75%) — 為[[漢翔]]、[[Safran Landing Systems]]、住友精密 ([[SPP]])、[[MOOG]]、[[三菱重工]]等供應起落架、發動機零件與機體結構件，終端客戶涵蓋[[GE Aerospace]]、[[Rolls-Royce]]、[[Boeing]]；", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md"}, "parent_claim_id": "4541:material_named_relationship:2ab6d5fc7471158f", "parent_effective_verdict": "UNKNOWN", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "晟田科技工業 (4541，Magnate Technology) 專注於高精密五軸 CNC 金屬加工，核心技術為超合金與難切削材料 ([[鈦合金]]、[[鎳基合金]]、Inconel) 之精密成型。業務結構：(1) 航太零組件 (佔營收約 75%) — 為[[漢翔]]、[[Safran Landing Systems]]、住友精密 ([[SPP]])、[[MOOG]]、[[三菱重工]]等供應起落架、發動機零件與機體結構件，終端客戶涵蓋[[GE Aerospace]]、[[Rolls-Royce]]、[[Boeing]]；(2) 半導體設備 (佔約 15%) — 為設備廠供應關鍵次系統零組件；(3) 食品包裝設備 (佔約 10%) — 供應[[三菱重工]]等食品飲料充填設備零組件。公司持有 AS9100、AS13100 及 Nadcap 等航太認證，為台灣 A-Team 4.0 核心成員。", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "4541 - 晟田"}, {"level": 2, "line": 3, "text": "業務簡介"}], "line": 9}], "purpose": "Original statement context only; not factual evidence.", "report_sha256": "4e83ddc50dbc451de1396b7fd64c2fca0928c72fc2125e1351c20a3836c3eb74", "requested_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md", "resolved_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md"}, "proposal_binding": {"input_path": "audit-v5/semantic/candidate-rerun/revision-aero-001/delivery/outcomes.jsonl", "input_sha256": "cf2d8b226e2f2ffa51dca6f21efa2ec7afaf802ef044692da42dbe16eb731490", "proposed_by": "alternative from revision-aero-001", "proposed_text_sha256": "eed2db502cb760d535439b199019c987c54e7549122fb7fa5af7494fc3281dca"}, "proposed_target_section": "業務與歷史資料", "qualifier_changes": [], "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md", "source_leads": [{"locator": "PDF第5頁（P4），致股東報告書，第87至89行", "title": "晟田科技工業股份有限公司114年度年報", "url": "https://maicl.com/upload/sponsor/2026063010155057.pdf"}, {"locator": "公司沿革，1997年及2001年條目，第139至141、172至176行", "title": "晟田科技工業股份有限公司－關於晟田", "url": "https://maicl.com/index.php?inter=about"}], "supersedes_revision_id": "revision:fada393e103fcd02879f:8ff172fe8abdcb12"}
{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:912fd3408c3cc05cd4ca:dcbac16a124b6e70", "cohort": "revision-aero-002", "current_report_sha256": "466121d777cae56b3586b0e57619f48580ff29b7eef59218659d12637d2d4844", "issuer_company": "長亨", "issuer_ticker": "4546", "normalized_claim_hash": "dcbac16a124b6e7057b4fb7e4bf6490c27fdf995a0410305cd96c2d042dc38a2", "original_text": "長亨精密股份有限公司105年度年報載明，Safran於民國104及105年度分別占長亨銷貨淨額88.78%及83.11%。", "parent_claim": {"author_batch_id": "author-003", "author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-003.json", "author_batch_sha256": "915c59950ac517f2bf0c3dbfa849d4a35c1997680eb8af844b3a801fd634ea59", "author_decision": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "claim_id": "4546:objective_ranking_or_market_share:db06b1cb4d0d13e1", "issuer_company": "長亨", "issuer_ticker": "4546", "normalized_claim_hash": "db06b1cb4d0d13e1697ff1cc445e8970d8fa60b545a2207c31dd027eb5cbe193", "original_text": "主力客戶為[[Safran]] (賽峰集團) 與[[GE Aerospace]]，產品 100% 外銷歐美大廠，多項引擎零組件全球市占第一。", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4546_長亨.md"}, "parent_claim_id": "4546:objective_ranking_or_market_share:db06b1cb4d0d13e1", "parent_effective_verdict": "PARTIAL", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "長亨精密 (4546，Chaheng Precision) 專注於航空發動機關鍵零組件之研發與製造，為全球少數能直接供應前三大航空引擎製造商之 Tier 1 供應商。核心產品涵蓋風扇葉片、壓縮段組合件、高壓擴散器、燃燒室熱段零件及渦輪氣封等，擁有逾 40 項特殊製程認證。主力客戶為[[Safran]] (賽峰集團) 與[[GE Aerospace]]，產品 100% 外銷歐美大廠，多項引擎零組件全球市占第一。公司與[[漢翔]]並列台灣僅有的兩家具備先進引擎零組件製造能力之企業，為 A-Team 4.0 核心成員。", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "4546 - 長亨"}, {"level": 2, "line": 3, "text": "業務簡介"}], "line": 9}], "purpose": "Original statement context only; not factual evidence.", "report_sha256": "466121d777cae56b3586b0e57619f48580ff29b7eef59218659d12637d2d4844", "requested_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4546_長亨.md", "resolved_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4546_長亨.md"}, "proposal_binding": {"input_path": "audit-v5/semantic/candidate-rerun/revision-aero-001/delivery/outcomes.jsonl", "input_sha256": "cf2d8b226e2f2ffa51dca6f21efa2ec7afaf802ef044692da42dbe16eb731490", "proposed_by": "alternative from revision-aero-001", "proposed_text_sha256": "dcbac16a124b6e7057b4fb7e4bf6490c27fdf995a0410305cd96c2d042dc38a2"}, "proposed_target_section": "業務與歷史資料", "qualifier_changes": [], "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4546_長亨.md", "source_leads": [{"locator": "About page, paragraph beginning 「長亨精密自2007年進入航太發動機零組件Tier-1市場」; list beginning 「公司目前有多項產品市佔率為全球第一」", "title": "長亨精密股份有限公司 — 長亨簡介", "url": "https://www.chaheng.com/chinese/about.php"}, {"locator": "PDF封面，第0頁，L0–L2", "title": "長亨精密股份有限公司105年度年報", "url": "https://www.chaheng.com/chinese/stakeholder1-4.php?DownSn=17&opp=download"}], "supersedes_revision_id": "revision:912fd3408c3cc05cd4ca:0eb3e6cecd253c50"}
{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:808724c838f9e9c25bdb:3731cf774e395213", "cohort": "revision-aero-002", "current_report_sha256": "c2161aac24ad340dbc9247d9b56bc83dfd0bfa7f4c4abc4a6cca921bdb00ee95", "issuer_company": "寶一", "issuer_ticker": "8222", "normalized_claim_hash": "3731cf774e395213cba27a875d6c7b81951b0c347dff3efbdac7948bee9502ce", "original_text": "寶一科技於2025年6月12日第二版《2024年溫室氣體盤查報告書》中，將Pratt & Whitney、Safran Aircraft Engines、Safran Transmission Systems、Safran Aero Boosters、川崎重工、MTU Aero Engines AG及GE Avio S.r.l.等列為主要客戶，並表示已取得航太引擎廠商的零組件認證及長期訂單。", "parent_claim": {"author_batch_id": "author-176", "author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-176.json", "author_batch_sha256": "41bc6e33fadea51dd9aa0c5b45047c6bc27450584d51897416cce8a5f4b6ea97", "author_decision": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "claim_id": "8222:material_named_relationship:710cbe41e0f8945e", "issuer_company": "寶一", "issuer_ticker": "8222", "normalized_claim_hash": "710cbe41e0f8945ecfe3c9712733a1cd46f6dfa67ddaf232f1e022d6c84ab6ea", "original_text": "客戶遍及美、法、德、日、義、比、波蘭等國，為[[Pratt & Whitney]]、[[Safran]]旗下多家子公司、[[川崎重工]]、[[MTU Aero Engines]]、[[GE Avio]] 等全球一線引擎大廠之重要 Tier 1/Tier 2 供應商。", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/8222_寶一.md"}, "parent_claim_id": "8222:material_named_relationship:710cbe41e0f8945e", "parent_effective_verdict": "PARTIAL", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "寶一科技 (8222，Aerowin Technology) 成立逾 40 年，專注於航空發動機關鍵零件之精密製造。核心技術涵蓋超合金與[[鈦合金]]之成型、焊接、加工、熱處理及表面處理，主力產品為引擎冷卻件與環件，廣泛應用於全球主流民用與軍用航空發動機。客戶遍及美、法、德、日、義、比、波蘭等國，為[[Pratt & Whitney]]、[[Safran]]旗下多家子公司、[[川崎重工]]、[[MTU Aero Engines]]、[[GE Avio]] 等全球一線引擎大廠之重要 Tier 1/Tier 2 供應商。受惠於[[LEAP]]、[[PW1000G]] 等新世代引擎量產放大，營收持續成長。", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "8222 - 寶一"}, {"level": 2, "line": 3, "text": "業務簡介"}], "line": 9}], "purpose": "Original statement context only; not factual evidence.", "report_sha256": "c2161aac24ad340dbc9247d9b56bc83dfd0bfa7f4c4abc4a6cca921bdb00ee95", "reque